title: Infoblox: DNS view configuration
agents: infoblox_csp
catalog: cloud/infoblox
license: GPLv2
distribution: mkp
description:
 Asserts that the DNSSEC settings on a DNS view match what you expect,
 covering DNSSEC itself, validation, and expiry validation.

 Each assertion is optional. An unset assertion reports the current value
 without judging it, so the check can be used purely for visibility. The
 state applied on a mismatch is configurable.

discovery:
 One service is created per DNS view in the tenant, on the tenant host.

item:
 The view name as configured in the portal.
